# Home Server / NAS PC - Justification

## CPU
The Intel Core i3-12100 was selected because it provides efficient performance and low power consumption.
It is suitable for NAS services, backups, and file sharing.

### Alternative Component
AMD Ryzen 5 5600G provides more cores and integrated graphics performance.

### Future Upgrade
Intel Core i5-13500 would improve virtualization and multitasking performance.

---

## Motherboard
The ASUS PRIME B760M-A WIFI D4 motherboard was selected because it provides stable performance and multiple storage options.
It also includes WiFi connectivity for flexible setup.

### Alternative Component
ASUS PRIME B550M-A-II WIFI supports AMD processors and similar features.

### Future Upgrade
MSI MAG Z790 TOMAHAWK WIFI provides more expansion and connectivity options.

---

## RAM
32GB DDR4 memory was selected because it provides stable multitasking for server applications and file management.

### Alternative Component
Crucial 32GB DDR4 offers similar capacity and reliability.

### Future Upgrade
DDR5 memory would improve future server performance and bandwidth.

---

## Storage
The WD Red Plus 8TB HDD was selected because it is optimized for NAS systems and 24/7 operation.
It provides reliable long-term storage for backups and files.

### Alternative Component
Seagate IronWolf Pro 8TB provides similar NAS-focused reliability.

### Future Upgrade
WD Gold 10TB would provide additional storage capacity and enterprise-grade reliability.

---

## Power Supply
The ASRock CL-550B PSU was selected because it provides enough power for a home server system with storage drives.

### Alternative Component
Corsair CX550 offers improved efficiency and reliability.

### Future Upgrade
Corsair RM650e would improve efficiency and support additional drives.

---

## Case
The Fractal Design Node 804 case was selected because it supports multiple storage drives and provides good airflow.
It is suitable for compact NAS builds.

### Alternative Component
Fractal Design Epoch XL provides larger interior space.

### Future Upgrade
A larger NAS-focused case could support additional hard drives.

---

## Monitor
The Dell P2422H monitor was selected because it provides reliable image quality for system monitoring and management.

### Alternative Component
AOC 24B3CF2 offers a higher refresh rate and modern IPS panel.

### Future Upgrade
ASUS VT229H touchscreen monitor could improve server management usability.

---

## Keyboard and Mouse
The Logitech MK295 Silent combo was selected because it provides quiet and comfortable operation.

### Alternative Component
The white version of the same combo offers identical functionality.

### Future Upgrade
Logitech MK540 Advanced would improve typing comfort and wireless connectivity.

